    <requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <summary>Lightweight, transparent Windows keep-awake utility with intelligent safety pauses.</summary>
    <description>IdleHarbor is a native Windows keep-awake utility with optional mouse movement, power-request modes, activity-aware pausing, lock and disconnect safety, battery protection, active hours, session limits, a notification-area menu, and an emergency stop hotkey.

The Chocolatey package installs the x64 portable application and does not configure automatic startup. IdleHarbor remains visible and user-controlled.</description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/Chris0Jeky/IdleHarbor/releases/tag/v0.1.0</releaseNotes>
    <tags>idleharbor mouse-jiggler keep-awake windows sleep power-management productivity</tags>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
  </files>
</package>
